<title>SRI LANKA: Ceylon Tobacco says 3-mth net down 4.3 pc.</title>
<headline>Ceylon Tobacco says 3-mth net down 4.3 pc.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in millions of rupees)</p>
<p>				1997		   1996</p>
<p>    Turnover	    4,294.86    vs     4,042.02</p>
<p>    Net profit	    101.74    vs	 106.26</p>
<p>    Tax provision	  40.29    vs	  59.05</p>
<p>NOTE - Results are unaudited. Ceylon Tobacco Ltd, Sri Lanka's monopoly cigarette-maker, is a subsidiary of B.A.T Industries Plc.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
